AUDIO: 'called Power Peg, which would execute a bunch of buy orders so Knight could watch how a stock\'s price would respond. And since the whole point was to push prices around, it was designed to buy aggressively at the current market price with zero concern for getting a good'

[02:40] [scene:talk]
